  "article": {
    "hero": {
      "title": "🌱 Lawn Care Business Name Generator",
      "tagline": "Names for mowing and lawn care firms, from Mow Worries to Precision Turf Care."
    },
    "intro": "A good lawn care business name is short, friendly and about the result: neat stripes and a weekend off. This **lawn care business name generator** has catchy and funny puns, classic family names, professional names for turf care firms and short modern ones, plus names from your town or your first name, with a slogan if you want one.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "Eight good lawn care business names",
        "content": "<p>All eight came from the generator, across its styles:</p><ul><li><strong>Green Stripe Lawn Care</strong>: the result every customer wants, in the name.</li><li><strong>Making the Cut</strong>: a catchy phrase that fits a mowing round.</li><li><strong>Mow Excuses</strong>: a funny pun that's easy to remember.</li><li><strong>Grass Class Lawn Care</strong>: a rhyme customers repeat.</li><li><strong>Fowler & Daughters Lawn Service</strong>: a classic family name, with a twist on '& Sons'.</li><li><strong>Benchmark Lawn Maintenance</strong>: professional, for commercial grounds contracts.</li><li><strong>Tuft</strong>: a short modern name that's easy to fit on a van.</li><li><strong>Hampton Precision Lawn Care</strong>: local and precise, built from your town.</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "heading": "What lawn care names have in common",
        "content": "<p>Lawn care is about tidy, regular work, so the strongest names promise neatness and reliability.</p><ul><li><strong>Stripes, edges and cuts</strong> are the visual promise. Lawn stripes come from the grass being bent in opposite directions by a roller, so the light reflects differently off each strip.</li><li><strong>Puns on mow</strong> (<em>Mow Regrets</em>, <em>Mow Turning Back</em>) are popular because they're short and funny on a van.</li><li><strong>Professional names</strong> with <em>Turf</em>, <em>Grounds</em> or <em>Maintenance</em> suit commercial contracts and sports grounds.</li><li><strong>Lawn or yard?</strong> British customers say lawn and garden; American customers often say yard. The generator uses both, so pick the one your customers use.</li></ul><p>Choose <strong>Name with a slogan</strong> for a line for your flyer, such as <em>Lawn & Order – The grass is greener here</em>.</p>"
      },
      {
        "heading": "Check it's free before you print the sign",
        "content": "<p>A van, a trailer and a stack of flyers all carry the name, and each costs money the moment it's printed, so check the name first. Press <strong>Check</strong> next to any name to open the <a href=\"../business-name-checker.html\">Business Name Checker</a>, which looks it up in one go:</p><ul><li><strong>The company register:</strong> Companies House in the UK, or your state's business register in the US. A limited company's name can't be the same as one already registered.</li><li><strong>Trade marks:</strong> the UK IPO and USPTO registers. Registering a company doesn't stop someone else owning the name as a trade mark.</li><li><strong>A domain and social handles,</strong> so customers can find you under the same name everywhere.</li></ul><p>This is general guidance, not legal advice. For the full process, read our guide, <a href=\"../guides/business-naming-best-practices.html\">Business Naming Best Practices</a>.</p>"
      },
      {
        "heading": "Tips for a mowing round",
        "content": "<ul><li><strong>Keep it short</strong>, so it fits on a trailer and a fridge magnet.</li><li><strong>Add your town</strong> if the name is common: it helps local search and makes handles easier to find.</li><li><strong>Leave room to grow</strong> if you might add hedge cutting, leaf clearance or full landscaping later.</li></ul><p>Doing full gardens? Try the <a href=\"landscaping-business-name-generator.html\">Landscaping Business Name Generator</a>. Other trades: the <a href=\"cleaning-business-name-generator.html\">Cleaning</a> and <a href=\"construction-company-name-generator.html\">Construction</a> name generators.</p><p>For more, see all the <a href=\"../categories/biz_trades-names.html\">trades and home services business name generators</a>.</p>"
      }
    ],
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "What are good lawn care business names?",
        "answer": "Short names that promise a neat result, like Green Stripe Lawn Care or Making the Cut, funny ones like Mow Excuses, or local ones built from your town. Choose Professional for commercial grounds names like Benchmark Lawn Maintenance."
      },
      {
        "question": "How do I check a lawn care business name is free?",
        "answer": "Press <strong>Check</strong> next to any name to see if it's free as a company, a domain and a social media handle. Then make sure: in the UK, search Companies House and the UK IPO trade mark register; in the US, search your state's business register and the USPTO trade mark search. A quick map search for the name in your area helps too."
      },
      {
        "question": "What's a good slogan for a lawn care business?",
        "answer": "Short, friendly and about the result: <em>We cut, you relax</em>, <em>Green lawns, clean lines</em> or <em>Get your weekends back</em>. Choose <strong>Name with a slogan</strong> in the Format menu to see names paired with one."
      },
      {
        "question": "What are some funny lawn care business names?",
        "answer": "Puns on mow and grass work best: Mow Excuses, Mow Regrets, Grass Class Lawn Care or Lawn Shot. Choose Funny for more."
      }
